            {
                "comment": "Professor Fischer is one of the most prestigious professors here in UW-Madison and it was my pleasure to have a chance taking his class. This is the last time CS367 being taught and he really made it a memorable class. But Professor Fischer is about to retire so take his classes if you have a chance.",
